config ESP_DEFAULT_CPU_FREQ_MHZ
    int "CPU frequency (MHz)"
    range 72 1008
    default 600
    help
        CPU frequency of the XuanTie C907 core. The download flow leaves it at 600 MHz; the start
        code raises PLL_CPU in steps of 72 MHz and tests the memory after each step (the limit of the
        PLL is 1008 MHz and the supply voltage is not changed). A step that fails the memory test is
        undone and the CPU stays at the last good frequency.

config ESP_RTC_F101_CLOCK_HOSC
    bool "Count the RTC seconds from the 24 MHz crystal"
    default y
    help
        The 32 kHz clock of the real time clock is the 24 MHz main crystal divided by 750: as accurate as the
        crystal, but it runs only while the chip is powered. Without it the clock keeps the source the boot
        code selected.
